# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
# Format: /old-path  /new-path  301
#
# Source of truth for ALL redirects (570+ rules). The Cloudflare Pages
# native _redirects file is silently capped at ~224 active rules; we work
# around that by deploying workers/redirects/, a Cloudflare Worker that
# parses this file at build time via scripts/generate-map.js and serves
# every redirect with no cap. CF Pages still uses this file for the first
# ~224 rules; the Worker is the durable backstop for the rest.
#
# Organized by subject. Order within a subject does NOT matter for the
# Worker (exact-match map, O(1)). Splat patterns inside a section are
# placed at the end of that section.

